source: Davis MD, Walsh BK, Sittig SE, Restrepo RD. AARC clinical practice guideline: blood gas analysis and hemoximetry: 2013 revision and update. Respir Care 2013;58:1694-1703. || AARC clinical practice guideline blood gas analysis hemoximetry
source: Berend K, de Vries APJ, Gans ROB. Physiological approach to assessment of acid-base disturbances. N Engl J Med 2014;371:1434-1445. || physiological approach assessment acid-base disturbances
